42
00:03:12.445 --> 00:03:19.165
Use the handbook's own Q and A as the bank, generated from the chapters so it never drifts (L1, L2).

43
00:03:19.445 --> 00:03:26.890
Drill in mixed, level-appropriate sets (L3), aloud, in the 30-second, then deep, then trade-offs, then follow-ups shape.

44
00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:30.946
Space the practice over weeks and finish with a full pass (L4).

